From 14a4701580830adb3d0ce4a7938fcc40b5e7b5bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 02:59:09 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] DL-168 avatar-preview

Open a character's avatar in the lightbox when it is clicked.

Works on the character page, the Characters list, the Overview party,
the profile photo and showcase portraits and the character peek dialog.
An avatar inside a link (the Overview party) previews instead of
following the link, and avatars that are buttons also open with Enter or
Space. No new image is exposed. No migration.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
